      "content": "it doesnt feel like a \"rut\" though. it feels more permanent than that. i spent my whole life building this version of myself, and now that it’s broken, there’s no rebuilding it. i'm just... finished. everything i was is gone. it feels like i'm just taking up space that should belong to someone who actually has a future.",
