      "content": "exactly. it's like the logic of my life has just collapsed. i used to believe everything had a trajectory, but now it's just... nothing. it's hard to imagine finding some \"new purpose\" when the foundation is completely destroyed. honestly, sometimes it feels like the most logical thing to do would be to just stop fighting it. like, why keep dragging this around if there's nothing underneath?",
